===Pokémon Adventures===
A Skier appeared in ''[[PS386|Disagreeable Graveler]]'', where he noticed {{adv|Platinum}} skiing through {{rt|216|Sinnoh}}. He wanted to help her out, but she declined, claiming that she could do it on her own. As Platinum almost crashed into him twice, he gave up.

